ght: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 26.4471%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Technician</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 73.5529%; height: 25px; text-align: left;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a Diploma (3 years) in Mechanical, Electrical, Instrumentation, Civil, Electrical &amp; Electronics, or Electronics Engineering with 50% marks (45% for SC/ST/PH).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 26.4471%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Trade Apprentice</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 73.5529%; height: 25px; text-align: left;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a 10th (Matriculation) Pass + 2-Year ITI in a relevant trade such as Fitter, Electrician, Electronics Mechanic, Instrument Mechanic, or Machinist, recognized by NCVT/SCVT.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 26.4471%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Graduate Apprentice</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 73.5529%; height: 25px; text-align: left;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a BBA / BA / B.Com / B.Sc. or equivalent Graduation in any discipline from a recognized University/Institute with 50% marks for General/EWS/OBC-NCL and 45% marks for SC/ST/PwBD candidates.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 26.4471%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Trade Apprentice DEO</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 73.5529%; height: 25px; text-align: left;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a 12th Pass (Below Graduate) + Domestic Data Entry Operator Skill Certificate with 1-year training fr